doc:FactsgearFault a None:Maintainable_item .
_:c782dd49687c3fc81c67a53cbbbb1540 rdf:reifies <<( doc:FactsgearFault rdf:type None:Maintainable_item )>> ;
	prov:wasDerivedFrom doc:99252ba83d9b .
doc:Factsarticle1_109 schema1:abstract "Among gearbox faults, gear tooth faults are dominant. Based on the influence of the meshing stiffness of the faulty gear on the dynamic transmission error of the gear, this study proposes to use the transmission error to diagnose and identify typical gear tooth faults. The paper calculates time-varying stiffness of faulty gear teeth, analyzes environmental noise effects on dynamic transmission error and vibration signals, builds an experimental platform, and uses a convolutional neural network to classify the data under different sample lengths and noise intensities. The transmission error signal shows higher gear fault diagnosis accuracy and improves anti-interference while reducing signal acquisition deployment cost." .
_:ca6c96f97aef3ff7ae53e09a42fca163 rdf:reifies <<( doc:Factsarticle1_109 schema1:abstract "Among gearbox faults, gear tooth faults are dominant. Based on the influence of the meshing stiffness of the faulty gear on the dynamic transmission error of the gear, this study proposes to use the transmission error to diagnose and identify typical gear tooth faults. The paper calculates time-varying stiffness of faulty gear teeth, analyzes environmental noise effects on dynamic transmission error and vibration signals, builds an experimental platform, and uses a convolutional neural network to classify the data under different sample lengths and noise intensities. The transmission error signal shows higher gear fault diagnosis accuracy and improves anti-interference while reducing signal acquisition deployment cost." )>> ;
	prov:wasDerivedFrom doc:99252ba83d9b .
doc:Factsarticle1_109 schema1:description "Article on gear fault classification and diagnosis using transmission errors and experimental validation." .
_:bb4085eedd0b2f0576170ee8056845c0 rdf:reifies <<( doc:Factsarticle1_109 schema1:description "Article on gear fault classification and diagnosis using transmission errors and experimental validation." )>> ;
